# Tallstrider Hatchling from the Strider Clutchmother in Darkshore (new in
# Forever).
# Sources: Forever's drop data, item 284176 (Strider Clutchmother, 0.6% in 886
# kills); npcs.json (her spawn, rare, level 20); beta item data (binds when
# picked up).
# ASSUMED: she respawns after about five and a half hours (the world
# database's Classic timer; Forever's is not known). In-game check: time
# between two of her spawns.

step Strider Clutchmother
  tip The Strider Clutchmother is a rare level 20 tallstrider in southern Darkshore, near the Master's Glaive. Kill counts so far give her about 0.6% per kill, roughly one in 170, and in Classic she comes back only every few hours: check her spot whenever you pass, rather than camping. The hatchling binds when you loot it, so it never reaches the Auction House.
  collect 284176 "Tallstrider Hatchling" @34.8,87.3 -- Strider Clutchmother
